<title>TURKEY: Turkey sets 2-year inflation-indexed bond auction.</title>
<headline>Turkey sets 2-year inflation-indexed bond auction.</headline>
<dateline>ISTANBUL 1997-04-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>Turkish central bank said the Treasury would auction on Tuesday two-year, inflation indexed bonds with three-month interest payments, after it sold 109.8 trln lira of similar two-year bonds on April 1.</p>
<p>Treasury has 199 trillion lira of t-bill redemption due on Wednesday.</p>
<p>    Maturity    : April 9, 1999</p>
<p>    Amount	: -</p>
<p>    Coupon	: -</p>
<p>    Auction date: April 8, 1997</p>
<p>    Value date  : April 9, 1997</p>
<p>-- Istanbul newsroom +90-212-275 08 75</p>
</text>
